window.products.push({"id":689128,"name":"SendNova Electric Wine Opener,Automatic Corkscrew Bottle Opener Set with Foil Cutter,Aerator Pourer,Vacuum Stopper,LED Light,Stainless Steel,Reusable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OzrTbMRHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELECTRIC WINE OPENER Take the foil cutter off and put onto the bottleneck, rotate the bottle in parallel for more than one circle, and cut off the foil seal. Hold the bottle firmly with one hand and hold the wine opener with the other. Place the bottom of opener body on top of the wine bottle to ensure the opener body remains in line with the wine bottle as much as possible. Press the extract button and hold, slightly press the opener body downward at the same time. The spiral will turn in a clockwise direction and enter the cork, then gradually remove it from the bottle. After the cork is entirely pulled out,Release the button and take the opener off. Press the upper release button and hold for 5-7 seconds, the cork automatically comes out from the opener, release the button, and complete the opening process. *This product is suitable for corks with a diameter of between 20mm and 24 mm and a height of 44mm. *This product is suitable for wine bottles with an bottleneck outer diameter of not more than 35 mm and an bottleneck inner diameter of between 17.5 mm and 23 mm. CAUTIONS *Hold the wine opener body and the wine bottle firmly during use. *Align the wine opener body with the wine bottle as much as possible, otherwise the cork cannot be easily pulled out. TROUBLE SHOOTING If the opener does not work or stops in the middle of uncorking: *Please check that the batteries are installed correctly. *Please confirm there is sufficient battery power. *Please confirm that the wine opener is aligned with the wine bottle vertically during the opening process. WINE POURER Insert the wine pourer into the bottleneck. Tilt the bottleneck to pour wine out from the wine pourer. MANUAL VACUUM PUMP SEALER Insert the sealer into the bottleneck firmly. Pull the handle up and down for about 15 times (for bottles with half wine left).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61OzrTbMRHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SendNova","source_asin":"B093BT89VT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093BT89VT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093BT89VT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
