window.products.push({"id":689152,"name":"Silverware Set, Bokadzi 20-Piece Flatware Cutlery Set,Stainless Steel Utensils Service for 4, Include Knife/Fork/Spoon, Mirror Polished (20-Piece) Dis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S52F0x6ZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bokadzi silverware set Our silverware set is made of durable food-grade stainless steel, rust corrosion proof. With classic looking and premium quality, it has become an indispensable tableware in daily life, and it also be the first choice for parties, banquets and holiday gifts. Package Includes: 4 x Dinner Forks, 4 x Salad Forks, 4 x Dinner Knives, 4 x Dinner Spoons, 4 x Teaspoons Beautiful Gift For Many Occasions: This stainless steel cutlery set has that \"wow factor\" and makes an excellent gift idea for various occasions. The lucky recipient can put them to use right away, and the silverware will keep on giving for years to come. Give them to a friend or family member for Christmas, Hanukkah, Anniversaries, Bridal Showers, Housewarming Parties, Weddings, and more. Classic Design That Catches Your Eye: Instantly upgrade any meal when you introduce this flatware set into your home. Expertly crafted from premium 18/0 stainless steel with a sleek, polished finish, this cutlery set exudes elegance and sophistication. It will fit in seamlessly with any tablescape, table decor, and dinnerware. Ergonomic Silverware,Rust Resistant Dishwasher Safe: When you pick up some silverware, you can instantly tell that quality is subpar just by the way it feels in your hand. They may feel flimsy, unbalanced, or have an unusual texture. Conversely, other silverware lets you know that they're high quality.You'll get a high-end feel the moment you pick up a utensil from our set.18/10 stainless steel is known for its durability and sturdiness. It's highly resistant to rust, bending, and general wear and tear. You can either wash this flatware by hand using soap and water or toss them in the dishwasher for an even faster clean up. Either way, they'll come out sparkling clean. Bokadzi is the definitive kitchenware brand with over 10 years of food service and hospitality industry experien","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S52F0x6ZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bokadzi","source_asin":"B09DG7SWYM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689152","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DG7SWYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DG7SWYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
