window.products.push({"id":689260,"name":"KOBO Dark Cassis Reed Diffuser, 9 oz | Premium Fragrance Diffuser Oils | 6-Month Long Lasting Room Diffuser for Home, Office | Natural Aromatherapy Sc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mbGWwwYVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DARK CASSIS - Embrace the luxurious richness of this premium room diffuser oil. A blackberry top note continues into the main body along with a wood accord of patchouli & sandalwood. This dries down to a sweet, sticky blackberry ripeness with an underlying musk character. WOODBLOCK COLLECTION - The Woodblock Collection is a line of decorative reed diffusers inspired by a sturdy, handcrafted age with a traditional aesthetic. The collection features eight unique and powerful scents housed in warm amber vessels with a clean, modern look that will fit in with any decor. 6 MONTH DIFFUSION TIME - The Woodblock Collection of reed diffusers for home can release fragrance for up to six months, providing a long-lasting and consistent aroma in your home, bedroom, living room bathroom, or office. Turn the reed sticks regularly for consistent, powerful fragrance output. LARGE 11\" REED STICKS - KOBO decorative diffuser set comes with reed sticks and a square glass vase- a stylish and elegant way to add a signature fragrance to your home or office. The 11\" long reed diffuser sticks are designed for optimal scent diffusion and ideal for use in larger rooms or open floor plans. A new home essentials must-have for home owners and anyone looking to add a personal touch to their space. CLEAN INGREDIENTS, MADE IN THE USA: We never use generic materials to create our products. Each of our products is made to specific standards in collaboration with the finest boutique fragrance houses in the U.S.- The Woodblock Collection of reed diffusers fragrances are made from natural, pure, and non-toxic ingredients and essential oils, making them safe for use around the home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mbGWwwYVL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOBO","source_asin":"B0BH8TLQ4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH8TLQ4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH8TLQ4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
