window.products.push({"id":689317,"name":"Mini Bag Heat Sealer 2 in 1 Portable Handheld Rechargeable Kitchen Vacuum Sealers Machine for Chip Bags, Plastic Food Storage Bags, Snack & Cereal Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IS3ywlIXL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"【Function Upgraded, Three Seal Modes, Seal All Kinds of Bags】Odziezet 2 in 1 mini heat sealer has been built with a high-tech circuit board for adjusting temperature, and has 3 modes to choose from ( mode for thick bags, common bags, and super thin bags ) . It’s a great help for you to store your leftover snacks, foods, fruits and so on, to avoid waste and mould growth , keep foods freshness. 【Triple Security, Safety Design, Easy to Use】The potato chip bag sealer has a built in high-tech circuit board, also has a great heat insulation effect which is SGS certified, and patented triple anti-scald and double high-tech protection makes it safe and reliable. Sealing bags by turning the knob to “+” position, and open bags by turning to “-” point. When do not use, turn the knob to the middle area of “+” and “-” to lock it and avoid unexpected heating, prevent children from hurting. 【USB Rechargeable, Long-lasting Working Time】A traditional battery powered heat sealer needs battery replacement frequently, this usb rechargeable bag sealer adopts high capacity (1300mAh) rechargeable lithium battery which can be used for about half a year after fully charged. This greatly helps you save time, money, and labor. Equipped with a 30cm long USB cable which is compatible with your cellphones, computers, power bank, car chargers etc, you can charge your bag sealer anytime anywhere 【Compact & Portable】The size of this mini bag resealer is 4.73x2.1x1.97 inches, compact and portable. With a hanging strip and the magnetic strip on back, you can hang it on the wall, behind the door or stick it to refrigerator for saving space. You also can put it into your backpack for camping, hiking, fishing or vacation，and use it to reseal those leftover snack bags or fruit bags when you left. 【Wide Application & Customer Guarantee】EEX bag sealer can sealing multiple common packaging bags: coated aluminum foil bags, PP, PE, PVC bags with thickness that is 0.3mm or less, eg.: common plastic bags, bags for rice, tea, chips, flavoring, salt, traditional Chinese medicine. It can fully meets your daily use requirements .If our portable food sealer does not reach to your expectations, we will full refund you-absolutely risk free, free replacement for quality problem, ORDER IT NOW!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41IS3ywlIXL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EEX","source_asin":"B084M5HYQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084M5HYQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084M5HYQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
