window.products.push({"id":689341,"name":"Mellbree Trash Can Lid Lock, 2Pcs Stainless Steel Outdoor Trash Can Strap Lock for Animals, Squirrels, Dogs and Raccoon Lid Lock Garbage Can","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UjKj0oE6L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"2-Pack trash can lock keeps pesky animals away from your outdoor trash can and keeps your surroundings clean! These Garbage Can locks ensure a firm grip and prevent animals from lifting the garbage lid, so you won’t find any mess around the trash bins!（Straps Only, Trash Can Not Included!） Full set of stainless steel outdoor trash can lid locks, refused to rust, durable and extremely durable. 5mm thick cable, 7*19 strands of stainless steel cable, the strength is far superior to the 7*6 on the market. Safe load capacity: 977 lbs, maximum load capacity: 2930 lbs. The trash can lid lock is very easy to install and remove for easy access when emptying the trash. INSTALLATION STEPS: Step 1: Punch holes on the trash can to install the square clips. Step 2: Install the screws/nuts/washers on the square buckle. Step 3: Snap the carabiner into the two square buckles on the trash lid to complete the lock. Its universal size fit all small, medium, or large trash cans with lids. Alien intruders will not manipulate carabiner, let alone bite through stainless steel ropes. Stainless steel bin lock straps contains: Stainless Steel Kit Contains: 2* Bold Cable; 4* Square Buckle; 2* Carabiner; 16* Screw Nut Spacer Combination (Sufficient Quantity) How long is the warranty/renew? We offer a hassle-free 12-month warranty and 24-hour friendly customer service. If there is any dissatisfaction with the product, or the parts are missing, please contact us at any time, whether it is a new one or a refund, we will definitely give you a satisfactory answer. Be responsible for your choice, let you place an order with peace of mind~","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UjKj0oE6L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mellbree","source_asin":"B0BD4PHWV7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD4PHWV7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD4PHWV7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
