window.products.push({"id":689392,"name":"Tongue Tied Drinking Game, Read the Tongue Twister or Take a Shot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81exw-C5aYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To play: The youngest player takes a card from the top of the pile, then reads the card aloud. The player reading the card needs to read the full card without making any mistakes. If they succeed, they win the round and do not have to drink. If they make a mistake, they lose the round and should drink their shot or 2 finger levels worth of drink from their own glass. Move in a clockwise direction to the next player and repeat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81exw-C5aYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paladone","source_asin":"B0849WMC13","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0849WMC13","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0849WMC13","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
