window.products.push({"id":689434,"name":"BREEKET Roll Up Dish Drying Rack, Over The Sink Multipurpose Dish Drying Rack, Foldable Kitchen Rolling Dish Drainer for for Kitchen Sink Counter (20.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810z62H0r9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Say Goodbye to The Watery Kitchen Counter- [20.5\" x 10.2\"] Doesn't take up the space of the kitchen counter, placed above the sink to easily drain the water from the dishes. Exquisite BREEKET dish drying rack perfectly matches the popular fashionable kitchen painting color theme. Please kindly measure your sink size firstly before purchasing this roll up over the sink dish drying rack! Multi Purpose Sink Rack - This roll up sink rack is suitable for draining knives, forks, plates, cups, pots or any cooking utensils. It can also be used as a water filter for washing fruits and vegetables, or for place the cutting board, or for defrosting frozen foods. Plus, the dish rack has a heat-resistant temperature of up to 797 ℉, and can be used as trivet mat for hot pots and pans to protect your elegant furniture. Premium Quality Built to Last - Made of sturdy and durable solid carbon steel, it will not be bent or twisted by heavy cooking utensils and can withstand up to 80 pounds. The surface of carbon steel adopts electrophoresis and baking varnish process, which features rust prevention, skid resistance, scratch resistance and heat resistance. Durable and flexible silicone straps on both sides have excellent grip to ensure it stays in place. Rollable & Detachable Design - The soft silicone material can be folded or cut according to the size you need, and the carbon steel can be taken out. Roll-up design can be easily and neatly stored in the cooking tool drawer or cabinet until the next use. Dish drying rack is well integrated with the kitchen decoration, and it is an excellent kitchen tool for creating a tidy kitchen and a comfortable home. Every Kitchen Needs One - Simple and practical over sink dish drying rack is easy to clean and can be wiped with a cloth or rinsed with water. Any issue with this drying rack, please contact us FIRST on order detail page before any return.100% worry-free, Lifetime Replacement Assurance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810z62H0r9S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BREEKET","source_asin":"B099HYX34L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099HYX34L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099HYX34L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
