window.products.push({"id":689558,"name":"FASTNOVA 12x16 inch Black Real Solid Wood Picture Photo Poster Print Art Frame Made to Display Picture 8x12 with Mat or 12x16 Without Mat, Wall Mounti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nrT1y99SL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"1. The two sides of acrylic sheet are covered with protective film, Please all torn off when use! 2. Wall Mounting Material Included: Black S hook and White non-trace nail . 3. The black S hook : It has been installed on the back of the picture frame. When Hanging the picture frame. Break open the sawtooth iron of the balck S hook to 45 degrees with your hand , to be able to hook the protruding tail of the white non-trace nail conveniently. 4. The white non-trace nail : It is in the extra small plastic bag. It has three thin needles and one protuberant tail. The needle must point to the metope, pay attention to direction and safety . The three thin needles were nailed to the wall without a trace, which was easy and firm. The protruding tail is used to hook the black S hook on the back of the picture frame, conveniently and quickly. 5.The frame is 2 cm Wide 2 cm Thick, 13 x 17 inch is the outside dimension of the photo frame, not the dimension of the photo. 6. 12 x 16 inch is the dimension of the photo that can be displayed without mat. Photos that are larger than or less than 12 x 16 inch can not be used without mat on the print frame. 7. Because the dimension of the accurate opening of the mat is (7+3/8) x (11+3/8), the display dimension of any size picture on the poster frame is (7+3/8) x (11+3/8), which is about 8 x 12. So 8 x 12 inch is the minimum dimension of the photo that can be displayed with mat. 8. The unmarked nail can not be used on hard walls such as tile and marble.if you want to use, please use electric drill and screw. 9. Can be used for matting photos, art, and needlepoint. 10. Great for crafts, backboards, signs, children's projects, company and school projects. 11. Good art frames Solutions at gallery. 12. Have 3-5 mm size measurement error, please careful purchase if particularly mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nrT1y99SL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FASTNOVA","source_asin":"B01NCKVRHN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NCKVRHN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NCKVRHN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":689559,"name":"Pure Country Weavers Namirya Blanket by Keith Mallett - African Cultural Gift Tapestry Throw Woven from Cotton - Made in The USA (72x54)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914Zf222cTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keith Mallet's lovely African women in triptych. Specifications This Tapestry Throw is 54 inches wide by 72 inches tall, and is woven from 100% cotton. Pure Country Weavers We are the world’s largest weaver of expertly crafted throw blankets, pillows, tote bags, and wall tapestries. Pure Country Weavers is dedicated to providing artisan quality home décor items to boutique stores worldwide. Soft to the touch and providing a warm, welcoming embrace, our blankets bring comfort to our clientele all over the world. Our Jacquard woven blankets are available in thousands of designs including over 200 breeds of Dogs, Cats, Horses and other animals. We are licensed to weave for over 500 Colleges, Universities, Fraternities and Sororities, We offer woven art depicting everything from Angels to Zebras. There is something here for everyone. All of our Pure Country Weavers designs are woven in the USA using advanced Jacquard weaving techniques, allowing us to generate a depth and texture not found in traditional home decor. · SOFT & BEAUTIFUL: Curl up in comfort with our super soft woven throw blanket. A perfect gift. · WOVEN NOT PRINTED: Woven from 8 miles of pure sustainably sourced American-grown cotton. · VERSATILE & STURDY: Our throws are large enough for a queen bed and perfect for naps on the sofa. · WASHER AND DRYER SAFE: Before leaving the mill our throws are pre-washed and dried so they will never shrink or fade. · AMERICAN MADE & FAMILY OWNED: Our throws are woven in our small family-owned mill located in the foothills of the Blue Ridge Mountains. Width: 54 Height: 72 UPC: 666576695356","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/914Zf222cTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pure Country Weavers","source_asin":"B005M4VBC0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005M4VBC0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005M4VBC0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
