window.products.push({"id":689594,"name":"Sola Wood Flower Rose 2.5 inches Sold by The Dozen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I0MrUztlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This sola wood flower is the staple of any sola floral artist. It is one of those styles that is super versatile. Keep the rose petals tight to the bud of the flower or with a little warm water you can reshape the flowers and make the rose literally blossom with all of the layers of petals spread out. We can see why this is a customer favorite! Features: Available 2.5 inches (additional sizes available) Soft, pliable, and easy to dye. Unique designs in every bouquet. Sold by the dozen These sola flowers are handmade and there can be a slight difference in size and shape from flower to flower. The American Beauty style flower the sizes are approximations depending on how tightly finished or opened the petals are the size of this flower in particular can range. Sola flowers are not fresh flowers. They are handmade wood flowers. The texture is similar to a really thin version of balsa wood. Because they are handmade, and made from natural materials, no two are exactly alike. Brown veining, sometimes small holes from a \"knot\" in the wood are on some of the flowers due to being made from the bark of a tree.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71I0MrUztlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oh You're Lovely","source_asin":"B07PCTRCBX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PCTRCBX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PCTRCBX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
