window.products.push({"id":689596,"name":"Reusable Bowl Covers in 3 Sizes (96 Covers) - Thick, Durable PE Plastic Plate and Food Covers with 360 Elastic – Transform Dishes, Aluminum Cans or Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bL6Ady0mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stop transferring leftovers to other containers Vida Line Reusable Plastic Covers for bowls and plates transform any container into a food storage solution. Featuring elastic around their full perimeters, they stretch over containers and recoil to fit snugly. This keeps foods in-place and helps to seal-out air to retain foods' full flavor and freshness. Instead of wasting time on food containers with lids that go missing or cling film laden with harmful chemicals, wrap-up more savings and savor every bite of your homemade meals. Vida Line has you covered This 96-piece set features 3 sizes of bowl and plate covers so you can preserve foods in small tins, prep bowls, soup tureens, on dinner plates and serving platters. Small covers fit 2.75\" - 5\" containers. Medium covers fit 4.5\" - 8.5\" bowls and salad plates. Large covers fit 6\" - 11.75\" dishes and cheese boards. Made with sturdy 30-micron PE plastic for long-lasting durability, these versatile food covers can even be stretched over tomatoes and melon halves to preserve unused portions for later. Reduce your carbon footprint Vida Line Bowl Plastic Bowl Covers with elastic are washable and reusable, making them an eco-friendly alternative to disposable cling wrap and sandwich bags. They are also color-coded in blue (small), yellow (medium) and red (large), making it fast and easy to select the size that you need. When the meal is over, effortlessly pack-away leftovers and enjoy more free time relaxing with family and guests. Take a bite out of household food waste. Add Vida Line Reusable Elastic Bowl Covers to your kitchen accessories today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bL6Ady0mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vida Line","source_asin":"B07ZCHK1RB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZCHK1RB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZCHK1RB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
