window.products.push({"id":689691,"name":"Cortesi Home Harper Counter Stool Beige Fabric Swivel Seat with Back","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":147.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p9LlwZN4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rustic french country charm comes to life with these counter stools. Weathered brown finish frame in solid oak wood is accentuated with a neutral thick weave linen upholstery and high density foam cushion. Features a full-ring footrest protected with a metal kick plate that ensures the longevity and sturdiness of this stool. This sturdy counter stool is a beautiful country-modern addition to your bar and kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81p9LlwZN4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cortesi Home","source_asin":"B01L5OX49I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L5OX49I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L5OX49I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":689692,"name":"Old Modern Handicrafts Queen Mary Collectible","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":314.41,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511auEDXECL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The queen Mary is considered by many as the pinnacle of British passenger shipbuilding. With its speed and finesse along the waters, the queen Mary bested any warship afloat and adopted the nickname, \"the gray ghost.\" Have it proudly displayed as a fully assembled model. Master craftsmen handcraft these highly detailed wood models from scratch using historical photographs, drawings and original plan. They are built to scale with high-grade wood such as: western red cedar, rosewood, and mahogany. They are 100% hand built individually using plank-on-frame construction method and are similar to the building of actual ships. Each model requires hundreds of hours to finish and must go through a demanding quality control process before leaving the workshop. The model is painted in red, black, and white to represent the original colors. It contains hundreds of exquisite details. There are dozens of realistic wooden life boats on both side of the main deck. All ladder, stanchions and rails are made of metal. The winches, life boats and hatches are meticulously handcrafted from wood. It is secured tightly on a solid wooden base with a brass nameplate. It'Ll make a perfect gift for home or office decorator, boat enthusiast, or passionate collector.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511auEDXECL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old Modern Handicrafts","source_asin":"B00A313DT6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A313DT6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A313DT6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":689693,"name":"myBeddie Bamboo Cooling Weighted Blanket with Removable Cover for Adults | Premium Weighted Cooling Blanket 20 lbs - 55x78 - White | Designed in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a9zD6VbeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️ Bamboo cooling weighted blanket: the cold touch of the bamboo weighted blanket and the glass beads have a specific feature to keep you cool all night-long by providing you tranquility. This feature provides a deep and relaxing sleep by allowing your body to rest and wake up refreshed. 7️⃣ Unique 7-layer design: 7-layer design and smaller diamond shape pockets help to distribute glass beads inside the blanket evenly so that your body would be comfortably surrounded. This relaxing state encourages deep and restful sleep. There are never issues with quilting cracking and glass bead leakage! 🌡️ Removable cooling/warming cover: each cooling weighted blanket comes with a removable dual-sided different textures duvet cover. The bamboo fabric side is cool to the touch and silky smooth, the other side is cozy plush fabric. Start off the evening on the cool side and as the night temperature lowers, you can flip the heavy blanket over to the warmer side. 💤 The perfect night of sleep: Use this cool weighted blanket on its own or with a duvet cover; great GIFT for every adult. Our bonus sleeping mask leads to one result: the most luxurious night of sleep you have been dreaming about! Great calming sensory blanket for adults to help decompress and provide comfort! ⛨ Satisfaction guarantee: We are a company that LOVES our customers and pride ourselves on values, quality, and service. Try our blankets for up to 30 days and if you aren't satisfied for any reason we'll provide fast, friendly service and a full refund. Improve your restful sleep quality throughout the night and be more productive throughout the day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a9zD6VbeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"myBeddie","source_asin":"B085GKM2GB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085GKM2GB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085GKM2GB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":689694,"name":"Bigso Alva Storage Boxes with Floating Lids, Leave a Gap, Salmon/Grey, Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fBNPEsx1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Bigso Alva is a stylish and durable storage box set with a floating lids. The lids leave a Gap to show off the inner box color. They're perfect for under-bed, office, or shelf storage. Set of two boxes with lids. Bigso paper laminate products have a core of thick, recycled fiberboard. The paper surface covering is applied with water-based glue. The look is contemporary and elegant. Bigso was founded in 1963 and at that time all our products were produced in recycled fiberboard. The emphasis in the beginning was on products that were tucked away in closets and attics. Fiberboard was seen as an economical solution for a range of storage needs for homes and businesses and our entire production went to the Swedish market. Bigso products have become a major decorating feature in the homes and offices of over 30 countries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fBNPEsx1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bigso","source_asin":"B0198A6ZSI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0198A6ZSI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0198A6ZSI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
