window.products.push({"id":689742,"name":"ZPPLD Artificial Rose Garland 2 Pack Vine Flowers Plants,13FT Fake Flowers Little Double-Ended Rose Garlands Hanging Rose with Ring Buckle for Wedding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rClbu4TmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Artificial flower garland fake rose vine well made and vibrantly colored looks realistic and beautiful Material: Silk flowers and leaves,plastic vines Color: Red 100% brand new and high quality Size of vine: Appr. 200 cm (6.5 FT) Dia of flowers: flowers heads 1.2\" Packing: 2 pcs Artificial Rose Vine Flower Garland (approx 120 flowers) Artificial flowers are hand-made by splicing flower heads and leaves. If they fall off, you can re-plug yourself. The flowers can be extracted or inserted easily, and they are not easy to fall. Each section has an adjustable buckle, which can be extended indefinitely. The flower stem is made of plastic. So it is normal to have a slight plastic odor. After it is placed in a ventilated place, the odor will disappear. Application: Suitable for decorating weddings, parties, homes, offices and other occasions, can also be hung on the wall, doors, swings, mirrors and other objects, for you to enjoy the pure natural style. How to maintain it? Please don't spend long time putting artificial plants in the water, especially hot water, or flowers will fade. If there is sticky dust, we suggest customer to use soft brush dips in water swept gently petals and leaves . Also you can use light concentration of salt water soak for 2 hours, then gently shake again in clean water, then hang to dry in ventilated place, keep away from the sun and dust removal to ensure color still gorgeous Simulation plants are flammable materials, please stay away from the candlestick, candles and incense If you have any questions about our products, please click \"contact seller\" to send us email, and we will reply promptly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rClbu4TmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZPPLD","source_asin":"B08HV5T6KB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HV5T6KB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HV5T6KB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
