window.products.push({"id":689954,"name":"Athorbot Bohemian Tapestry Wall Hanging, Hippie Mandala Tapestry Black and White Floral Wall Art Collage Dorm Home Decor Beach(80 x 60 inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UW-zQajHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"GREAT QUALITY: This teal mandala tapestry with 100% polyester allows show you a wonderful mandala world wall decor art. HIGH QUALITY DESIGN: This teal mandala tapestry adopt HD digital printing, more clear, vibrant colorful design will light up your room. The mystery of mandala tapestry will bring you good luck! CARE GUIDE: Hand wash or machine wash in cold water, dry and iron in low temperature. NICE SERVICE: Your 100% satisfaction is our #1 priority. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE if you would like to return our products for any reason. INCLUDED: 1 × Bohemian Tapestry. WARM TIPS: 1. How to get out of creases? No worry about the teal tapestry with folds. You can wash it and hang to dry before using. Low temperature ironing on it is also working. 2. How to hanging this mandala tapestry? This grey tapestry is very easy to hang by using decorative tacks, push pins, thumbtacks or Velcro tapes. 3. About color difference Due to different dis-player, it is normal that images may have little color difference. Click “Add To Cart”, Make Smart Choice!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UW-zQajHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ATHORBOT","source_asin":"B082HG26S2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082HG26S2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082HG26S2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":689955,"name":"Kotobuki Wakasa Lacquer Japanese Artisan Chopsticks, Kai Chirashi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31r6ZKyVLGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Wakasa nuri hashi (Wakasa lacquer chopsticks) have been made in Japan in Fukui prefecture since the Edo period, dating back many centuries. Craftsmen in Wakasa apply multiple layers of lacquer to each chopstick, and depending on the style, may also incorporate small pieces of seashell or mother of pearl to enhance the design. After applying layer upon layer of lacquer, the chopstick is then carved or polished. Wakasa chopsticks that are simply polished often have colorful, organic patterns that reveal the many coatings of lacquer and inlaid shell beneath. Carved Wakasa chopsticks on the other hand often have wood grain-like patterns that reveal the different colors and fine layers of the many coats of lacquer. Each Wakasa lacquer chopstick is very labor intensive, and can contain upwards of 50 layers of lacquer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31r6ZKyVLGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kotobuki","source_asin":"B00BFTKDMU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-689955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BFTKDMU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BFTKDMU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
